OL,3,GNEWSAElizabeth line worker died after
OL,4,Apunch, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Elizabeth line railway worker died
OL,7,Fafter being punched in the face with
OL,8,F"significant force" by a passenger, a
OL,9,Fjury has been told.
OL,11,FJorge Ortega, 61, hit his head on the
OL,12,Fconcrete platform at Ilford station,
OL,13,Feast London, and died of a severe
OL,14,Ftraumatic brain injury two days after
OL,15,Fthe 4 December 2024 attack.
OL,17,FAyodele Jamgbadi, 30, of Kingston Road,
OL,18,FIlford, is charged with Ortega's
OL,19,Fmurder. Inner London Crown Court heard
OL,20,Fon Tuesday that he was not fit to make
OL,21,Fa plea or take part in his murder
OL,22,Ftrial.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
